Package: uncovr
Title: Code Coverage for Testthat
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:c(
    person("Gábor", "Csárdi", , "csardi.gabor@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Posit Software, PBC", role = c("cph", "fnd"),
           comment = c(ROR = "03wc8by49"))
  )
Description: A code coverage tool for testthat. Supports line coverage,
    function coverage, top-level expressions, multiple independent builds,
    parallelism, lcov output, hyperlinked terminal report, HTML report,
    codedov.io uploads. Can measure the coverage of a pull request, a git
    commit, a git branch. It has fast instrumentation and fast coverage
    counters with very low overhead.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/gaborcsardi/uncovr
BugReports: https://github.com/gaborcsardi/uncovr/issues
